58
00:07:35.505 --> 00:07:36.941
<i>- It's "that." It's "that."
- I said it</i>

59
00:07:36.965 --> 00:07:40.594
- I swear to God. it's "that." It's "that."
- It. it. it. it!

60
00:07:40.677 --> 00:07:42.530
- All right. fine. Let's start again. Ready?
- All right. fine. fine. fine.

61
00:07:42.554 --> 00:07:46.057
<i>All right. I met him at a party</i>

62
00:07:46.183 --> 00:07:49.895
<i>And he told me how to drive</i>

63
